--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -5,6 +5,8 @@ Version 8.0
 
 Unreleased
 
+-   Inherit ``Context.show_default`` from the parent context when it is
+    not set, so group settings apply to subcommand help.
 -   Drop support for Python 2 and 3.5.
 -   Adds a repr to Command, showing the command name for friendlier
     debugging. :issue:`1267`, :pr:`1295`
